{
  "$schema": "../../node_modules/oxlint/configuration_schema.json",
  // The Prickles canon v2.0 ESLint pack (https://prickles.org/implementation, CC BY-NC 4.0), as `@oxlint/migrate@1.87.0 --type-aware` writes it.
  // Rules oxlint lacks run through the pack's own ESLint plugins as oxlint JS plugins. ADR-0017 lists every difference from the pack.
  // Change a rule here only to follow a new pack release; Argo's own rules live in argo.json.
